Z||000000||Fiero*101||10-28-2001||02:23 AM||||Just making convorsation<BR>But i live in a very small comunity and its REALLY rare to see anything else but ricers here but today i saw  Fiero's i couldnt believe it. The first one i saw Friday night.<BR>it was a Silver 84 or 85 SE w/ a sun roof it was in pretty good conditon,but the headlights were stuck open  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>the second i saw later today was a Red 84 SE it was in real good shape. Then tonight i was out on the state high way i come to a stop and this Black 86 GT comes pulling up on the side. Then when i was coming home i saw another one this was a White 84 SE.<P>I was just wondering why is it that IF i do happen to see one there all 84 or 85 SE's was there more made b/c where ever i go i rarely see a GT of any year.<P>Just thought i would share my story<BR>sorry it was so long<P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6||||reg||1
Z||000001||Philphine||10-28-2001||07:07 AM||||i'm in a fairly good sized city and i don't see gt's (the 86-88 ones) very often. at the most i've seen two in a day. hadn't seen 'em before, haven't seen them since. i'm liable to see a coupe or se/gt anytime i go out. saw three yesterday.||||reg||1
